      "q": "How much does Johns Hopkins University Applied Physics Laboratory make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Johns Hopkins University Applied Physics Laboratory obligated $1.4B in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. The Laboratory received 684 awards for the period with an average award size of $2.1M, and obligations fell 40.7% year over year."
